# Grim Javelineer: "Whenever you attack, target attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn." Bot1 attacks on turn 3 with the
# Javelineer (3/2) and Memnite (1/1) and keeps Ornithopter home. The trigger's target must be an attacking creature: the
# Ornithopter (Bot1's, not attacking) and Bot2's Ornithopter are refused, Memnite is chosen and is a 2/1 (power +1, toughness
# unchanged) while the Javelineer stays 3/2: 3 + 2 = 5 damage, Bot2 at 15. On turn 5 the pump has ended: Memnite is 1/1 again.
